3257649508978688", "start": 191, "username": "instinct"}, {"end": 208, "id": "2351805762", "start": 203, "username": "resy"}, {"end": 463, "id": "1797154805129113600", "start": 452, "username": "noahrshinn"}]}, "text": "ok @instinct back w/ the sick shipping speed\n\njust announced formal partnership w/ @OpenTable that lets users make + change reservations\n\n> @OpenTable: bookable in @ChatGPT, meta muse, + now @instinct\n> @resy: can search in chatgpt but booking runs thru a resy pop-up\n\nmakes sense given the biz models --> resy has the high demand restaurants + scarce tables so it can afford to gatekeep. OT is more long tail so it wants all the coverage it can get \n\n@noahrshinn lmk when resy is live \ud83e\udd23"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1222, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ok @instinct back w/ the sick shipping speed\n\njust announced formal partnership w/ @OpenTable that lets users make + change reservations\n\n&gt; @OpenTable: bookable in @ChatGPT, meta muse, + now @instinct\n&gt; @resy: can search in chatgpt but booking runs thru a resy pop-up\n\nmakes sense https://t.co/PeLLu60w0e", "url": "https://x.com/jbahrdestefano/status/2116263231480287505"}, {"author_id": "2116260659793199104", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:13:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116262234909471168"], "id": "2116262234909471168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AEON_Community @Meta @Muse fg thg n", "url": "https://x.com/hfivvbn/status/2116262234909471168"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116260788021125120"]}, "author_id": "991940486616186880", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:08:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116260976001728676"], "id": "2116260976001728676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI that works while you sleep \ud83e\udde0\n\nChatGPT Dots, Meta Muse and Claude Duet check your apps, send a daily brief and do tasks, and they ask before sensitive actions.\n\nRule #1: never connect your MoMo or bank app.\n\nWhich one would you trust? \ud83d\udc47\n\n#AI #AIAgents https://t.co/Jo34H5BjM3", "url": "https://x.com/smartzgh/status/2116260976001728676"}, {"author_id": "2000777901688676352", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:00:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116259082160283650"], "id": "2116259082160283650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse\u3067comfyui\u3092\u64cd\u4f5c\u3055\u305b\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u30dd\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u898b\u305f\nMuse\u306bVOICEVOX\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3055\u305b\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u30dd\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u898b\u305f\n\n\u3053\u308cMuse\u306bcomfyui\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3057\u3066\u52d5\u304b\u305b\u308b\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u304b\n\u3063\u3066\u601d\u3063\u3066\u805e\u3044\u305f\u3051\u3069GPU\u304c\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3089\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3051\u3069\u3059\u3054\u3044\u6642\u9593\u304c\u304b\u304b\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3089\u3057\u3044\n\u6b8b\u5ff5", "url": "https://x.com/z99999999922/status/2116259082160283650"}, {"author_id": "18643124", "created_at": "2026-10-30T19:51:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116256712248430755"], "id": "2116256712248430755", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@soleio @spc @alexcornell @Meta @Muse Nice", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfesta/status/2116256712248430755"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116281355453816832", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV6KriSbYAA_G-y.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2116275596477222912", "type": "ph